  {
   "id": "MAPMES00:aaf32",
   "off": 700210,
   "op": "21",
   "group": "speaker",
   "jp": "番兵Ｂ\r",
   "en": "Guard B\r",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES00:aaf3b",
   "off": 700219,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "「夜は化け物がうろついて\r  るって噂もあるし…\u0010\b  夜の見張りは酒でも飲まな\r  いと やってられねえよ」\u0010",
   "en": "\"Word is there's monsters prowlin' about at night...\u0010\bCan't stand night watch without a drink, I tell ya.\"\u0010",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES00:aafa7",
   "off": 700327,
   "op": "21",
