   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES00:ab009",
   "off": 700425,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "「夜は宿へ帰って\r  出歩かないことだな」\u0010",
   "en": "\"At night, you'd best get back to your inn and stay off the streets.\"\u0010",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES00:ab037",
   "off": 700471,
   "op": "21",
   "group": "speaker",
   "jp": "通行人Ａ\r",
   "en": "Passerby A\r",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES00:ab042",
   "off": 700482,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "「ケガをしたなら\r  医療聖堂の治療院に\u0010\b  行きなさい\u0010\b",
   "en": "\"If you've been hurt, the Temple of Medicine's clinic\u0010\bis where you want to go.\u0010\b",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES00:ab079",
   "off": 700537,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "  どんな傷でも 治して\r  くれます」\u0010",
   "en": "They can heal any wound.\"\u0010",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES00:ab0a2",
   "off": 700578,
   "op": "21",
   "group": "speaker",
   "jp": "通行人Ｂ\r",
   "en": "Passerby B\r",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES00:ab0ad",
   "off": 700589,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "「王国の娘 キラル様は\r  美しい黒髪の娘です\u0010\b",
   "en": "\"Kiral-sama, the Daughter of the Kingdom, is a beautiful girl with black hair.\u0010\b",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES00:ab0db",
   "off": 700635,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "  私の子供が助かったのも\r  キラル様のおかげです」\u0010",
   "en": "My child was saved thanks to Kiral-sama.\"\u0010",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES00:ab113",
   "off": 700691,
   "op": "21",
   "group": "speaker",
   "jp": "通行人Ｃ\r",
   "en": "Passerby C\r",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES00:ab11e",
   "off": 700702,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "「キラル様は５０年ぶりの\r  王国の娘じゃ\u0010\b",
   "en": "\"Kiral-sama is the first Daughter of the Kingdom in fifty years, y'know.\u0010\b",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES00:ab149",
   "off": 700745,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "  ここ１年ほどは大聖堂に\r  こもって 姿をお見せに\r  ならんが…」\u0010",
   "en": "But this past year or so, she's kept herself shut up in the Cathedral and hasn't shown her face, eh...\"\u0010",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES00:ab18f",
   "off": 700815,
   "op": "21",
   "group": "speaker",
   "jp": "通行人Ｄ\r",
   "en": "Passerby D\r",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES00:ab19a",
   "off": 700826,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "「遠い昔 多くの者が病で\r  命を落とした時\u0010\b",
   "en": "\"Long ago, when many were dying of disease,\u0010\b",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES00:ab1c6",
   "off": 700870,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "  始まりの母が 王国の娘を\r  遣わされ 人々の命を\r  救ったといいます」\u0010",
   "en": "they say the First Mother sent the Daughter of the Kingdom to save the people's lives.\"\u0010",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES00:ab211",
   "off": 700945,
   "op": "21",
   "group": "speaker",
   "jp": "兵士風の男\r",
   "en": "Soldierly Man\r",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES00:ab21e",
   "off": 700958,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "「俺は新しい目を入れて\r  もらったのさ\u0010\b",
   "en": "\"I had a new eye put in.\u0010\b",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES00:ab247",
   "off": 700999,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "  ずいぶん高くついたがね」\u0010",
   "en": "Cost me a pretty penny, though.\"\u0010",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES00:ab268",
   "off": 701032,
   "op": "21",
   "group": "speaker",
   "jp": "乞食\r",
   "en": "Beggar\r",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES00:ab26f",
   "off": 701039,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "「おめぐみを …」\u0010\r",
   "en": "\"Spare a coin...?\"\u0010\r",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES00:ab284",
   "off": 701060,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "  ５Ｇをあたえますか？",
   "en": "Give him 5G?",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES00:ab2a5",
   "off": 701093,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "「それは 残念なことじゃ」\u0010",
   "en": "\"Ah, that's a shame, that is.\"\u0010",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES00:ab2d3",
   "off": 701139,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "「何と！わしのような乞食に\r  与える金もないとは！\r  かわいそうにのう…\u0010\b  …\u0010  …\u0010  …\u0010  …\u0010  …\u0010\b  これは わしからの\r  プレゼントじゃ\r  大事に持っているがよい」\u0010\b",
   "en": "\"What! You've not even got a coin for an old beggar like me? You poor soul...\u0010\b...\u0010 ...\u0010 ...\u0010 ...\u0010 ...\u0010\bHere's a little present from me. Keep it safe, eh.\"\u0010\b",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES00:ab38f",
   "off": 701327,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "「何と わしのような乞食に\r  与える金もないとは！\r  かわいそうにのう…\u0010\b  わしが与えたアイテムも\r  持っていないようじゃし\r  やれやれじゃのう」\u0010",
   "en": "\"What! You've not even got a coin for an old beggar like me? You poor soul...\u0010\bAnd it seems you don't even have the item I gave you. Dear, oh dear.\"\u0010",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES00:ab421",
   "off": 701473,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "「何と わしのような乞食に\r  与える金もないとは！\r  かわいそうにのう…\u0010\b  じゃが もう おぬしには\r  何もやれんぞ」\u0010",
   "en": "\"What! You've not even got a coin for an old beggar like me? You poor soul...\u0010\bBut I've nothin' more to give ya, I'm afraid.\"\u0010",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES00:ab4a4",
   "off": 701604,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "「へへ… ありがとう\r  ございやす\u0010\b",
   "en": "\"Heh heh... Much obliged, guv.\u0010\b",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES00:ab4c8",
   "off": 701640,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "  ところで だんな\r  おととい 北の空に妙な\r  雲が見えましたが\u0010\b  ありゃ なんですかねぇ」\u0010",
   "en": "By the way, guv... The day before yesterday, there was a strange cloud in the northern sky.\u0010\bWhat d'you reckon that was?\"\u0010",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES00:ab532",
   "off": 701746,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "「へへ… ありがとう\r  ございやす\u0010\b",
   "en": "\"Heh heh... Much obliged, guv.\u0010\b",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES00:ab556",
   "off": 701782,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "  ところで だんな\u0010\r  東地区の丘の上の\r  屋敷に 毎晩怪しい光が\u0010\b  ともるのを知ってやすか」\u0010",
   "en": "By the way, guv...\u0010 D'you know about the strange light that shows every night\u0010\bat the mansion on the hill in the East District?\"\u0010",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES00:ab5c2",
   "off": 701890,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "「へへ… ありがとう\r  ございやす\u0010\b",
   "en": "\"Heh heh... Much obliged, guv.\u0010\b",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES00:ab5e6",
   "off": 701926,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "  大きな声じゃ言えねえん\r  ですがね\u0010\b  前の王様は 殺されたん\r  だっていう話ですぜ…」\u0010",
   "en": "Can't say it too loud, mind...\u0010\bbut word is the old King was murdered...\"\u0010",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES00:ab64e",
   "off": 702030,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "「へへ… 毎度ありがとう\r  ございやす\u0010\b",
   "en": "\"Heh heh... Much obliged, as always.\u0010\b",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES00:ab676",
   "off": 702070,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "  ですが だんな\u0017 もう\r  あっしが知っている\r  情報は ありませんぜ」\u0010",
   "en": "But, guv,\u0017 that's all the news I've got.\"\u0010",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES00:ab6c4",
   "off": 702148,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "貼り紙がある\u0010\r「反逆者に関する情報には\r  賞金をあたえる」\u0010",
   "en": "There's a notice.\u0010 \"A reward will be paid for information on rebels.\"\u0010",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES00:ab702",
   "off": 702210,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "貼り紙がある\u0010\r「夜間 女性や子供は\r  出歩かないこと！」\u0010",
   "en": "There's a notice.\u0010 \"Women and children must not go out at night!\"\u0010",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES00:ab73d",
   "off": 702269,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "貼り紙がある\u0010\r「あらたな増税については\r  おって発表する」\u0010",
   "en": "There's a notice.\u0010 \"Details of new taxes will be announced in due course.\"\u0010",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES00:ab77b",
   "off": 702331,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "壁に落書きがある\u0010\r「増 税 反 対 ！」\u0010",
   "en": "There's graffiti on the wall.\u0010 \"NO TAX HIKES!\"\u0010",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES00:ab7a4",
   "off": 702372,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "壁に落書きがある\u0010\r「魔導聖堂の横暴を\r  阻止しよう！」\u0010",
   "en": "There's graffiti on the wall.\u0010 \"Stop the Temple of Sorcery's tyranny!\"\u0010",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES00:ab7de",
   "off": 702430,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "大門は 閉ざされている\u0010",
   "en": "The Great Gate is closed.\u0010",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES00:ab7f8",
   "off": 702456,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "東地区への門は\r閉ざされている\u0010",
   "en": "The gate to the East District is closed.\u0010",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES00:ab81a",
   "off": 702490,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "西地区への門は\r閉ざされている\u0010",
   "en": "The gate to the West District is closed.\u0010",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES00:ab83c",
   "off": 702524,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "カギが かかっている\u0010\b",
   "en": "It's locked.\u0010\b",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES00:ab853",
   "off": 702547,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "？\u0017\r『リオの家』と書いてある\u0010",
   "en": "?\u0017 It says \"Rio's House.\"\u0010",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES00:ab877",
   "off": 702583,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "倉庫の床に蓋がしてある\u0010",
   "en": "There's a hatch in the warehouse floor.\u0010",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES00:ab89a",
   "off": 702618,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "アンブローズ城が見える\u0010",
   "en": "Ambrose Castle is in view.\u0010",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MAPMES00:ab8bc",
   "off": 702652,
